  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{答|こた}える (answer X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {答|こた}えている = 'is answering.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・⟦{質問|しつもん}→質問：00888_shitsumon⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{答|こた}える (answer a question)\n・⟦{正直|しょうじき}→正直：01562_shoujiki⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{答|こた}える (answer honestly)\n・〜⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{答|こた}える (answer that ~, reply with ~)\n・⟦{答|こた}え→答え：00790_kotae⟧ (noun: answer)\n\nIMPORTANT: Takes に particle, not を. Compare: ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧ takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for questions.\n\nNOT USED FOR PHONES: answering a ringing telephone is ⟦{電話|でんわ}→電話：01471_denwa⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{出|で}る→出る：00513_deru⟧, never {答|こた}える. {答|こた}える is only for replying to a question or request.",
